# The repository root ignores __pycache__/, *.pyc, .venv, .build/, .ruff_cache/, .pytest_cache/,
# .DS_Store and *.egg-info/. The baseline and stray-files fixtures deliberately CONTAIN those,
# because the tests prove they are not hashed; a nested .gitignore is the only way to keep them in
# the repo without touching the root rules.
!__pycache__/
!*.pyc
!.venv
!.build/
!.ruff_cache/
!.pytest_cache/
!.DS_Store
!*.egg-info/
